By Ashutosh Tiwari

Subtitle: 95 Tricks and Techniques — Tools to Spot Lies, Hidden Agendas, and Subtle Emotional Cues.

Genre: Communication, social psychology, observation, and interpersonal skills.

Central idea: Become more aware of people's expressions, behaviour, communication patterns, and emotional cues so you can understand social situations more thoughtfully.

